From: Sinty A <a@sinty>
Date: 2026-07-08
Subject: [PATCH] fcobjs: drop the "using without calling FcInit()" stderr warning

Fontconfig auto-initializes on first use (FcObjectInit runs right below), so
this warning is cosmetic; it only clutters the labwc log at greeter and
desktop startup. Sinty wants a clean log, so drop the line. Local-only, not
submitted upstream.

Signed-off-by: Sinty A <a@sinty>
---
 src/fcobjs.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

--- a/src/fcobjs.c
+++ b/src/fcobjs.c
@@ -88,7 +88,6 @@
     ots = fc_atomic_ptr_get (&other_types);
     if (obj_ref.count < 1) {
 	if (!warn) {
-	    fprintf (stderr, "Fontconfig warning: using without calling FcInit()\n");
 	    warn = FcTrue;
 	}
 	FcObjectInit();
